items.Upgrade_Fertilizer.description = Right-click a Harvester to install: it fertilizes planted soil in its area using Poop (2 per soil block by default) and then Fertilizer bags from any slot of the Harvester (and keeps both out of the export). Crouch + F on the Harvester removes the last upgrade.
